# E §6.3: "a pair of rows stated same is one movement: the ledger lists it once, on one line, and names both rows";
# L §6.1: "a place two of them book ... where they give it different amounts or days it is a hole movement there
# (HOLE-SAME)". Two statements both cover konto, their rows of one transfer stated same and disagreeing (950.00 and
# 940.00; M2 patch case P35, P46, G4's fix review item 1, its probes g3_amt and p_both_konto_amt): konto's balance is
# the HOLE-SAME, and its ledger lists the movement once, observed that hole (refcore listed both rows: observed
# -1 890.00, difference -940.00).
# tally 2.2.1 (237.2), HOLE-SAME's row: one fact, the leg by its name (`leg cash`); tally 2.2 said `the leg at <place>`.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input keep: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to sav amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - keep)

ask q_konto: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask q_led: residuals konto 2026-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "a"

version st_k2
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-04
  covers konto
  bank[c1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 940.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "c"
  same bank[a2] = bank[c1]
=== expect
q_konto: ?"bank[a2] and bank[c1] are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[c1])" (bank[a2], bank[c1])
  cut 2026-04-10
q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -950.00 PLN, observed ?"bank[a2] and bank[c1] are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[c1])" (bank[a2], bank[c1]), difference ?"bank[a2] and bank[c1] are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[c1])" (bank[a2], bank[c1])
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -950.00 PLN, observed ?"bank[a2] and bank[c1] are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[c1])" (bank[a2], bank[c1]), difference ?"bank[a2] and bank[c1] are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[a2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[c1])" (bank[a2], bank[c1]), timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of save[2026-03] disagree: bank[a2] (950.00 PLN) and bank[c1] (940.00 PLN)
